# S02: Play Surface and Native Menu — UAT

**Milestone:** M001
**Written:** 2026-10-09T19:18:39.183Z

## UAT: Play Surface and Native Menu

**Slice:** S02 — Milestone M001

### Pre-conditions
- App built and installed on device/emulator
- At least one game registered in GameRegistry (S01 deliverable)
- local.properties points to valid Android SDK

### UAT Type
- UAT mode: runtime-executable

### Checks

| # | Description | Expected Outcome | Mode |
|---|-------------|-----------------|------|
| U1 | Launch app, navigate to a registered game, enter play surface | WebView renders game content; session state is OPENING then PLAYING | runtime |
| U2 | Open native menu while game is playing | Menu overlays without recreating WebView; game remains active in background | runtime |
| U3 | Trigger each of 7 menu actions (Resume, SnapshotNow, Checkpoint, Vault, Reload, Display, ReturnToHub) | Each action fires onAction callback; menu closes after ReturnToHub; no WebView recreation | runtime |
| U4 | Press Android Back while menu is open | Menu closes; session stays PLAYING; no silent navigation back | runtime |
| U5 | Press Android Back while menu is closed | App navigates back to launcher; session transitions to CLOSING then CLOSED | runtime |
| U6 | Rotate device / change window size while menu is open | Layout adapts (compact→bottom sheet, wide→side panel); WebView identity stable | runtime |
| U7 | Trigger configuration change (IME open/close) while playing | FoldAwareLayout adjusts insets; WebView content not covered by keyboard | runtime |
| U8 | Run ./gradlew :app:assembleDebug --no-daemon | BUILD SUCCESSFUL | artifact |
| U9 | Run ./gradlew :app:testDebugUnitTest --tests "com.example.hub.session.SessionStateTest" | 30/30 tests pass | artifact |
| U10 | Run ./gradlew :app:testDebugUnitTest --tests "com.example.hub.ui.WebViewHostTest" | 4/4 tests pass | artifact |
| U11 | Run ./gradlew :app:testDebugUnitTest --tests "com.example.hub.ui.NativeMenuTest" | 30/30 tests pass | artifact |

### Edge Cases
- E1: Menu opened/closed rapidly while game loads — WebView identity must remain stable
- E2: SessionState is CLOSED — WebViewHost must not create a WebView (early return)
- E3: Different gameId values — each must produce a distinct AndroidView factory invocation
- E4: Profile bind must occur before loadUrl in WebViewHost factory
